Fort Frostmoth|An Imperial Fort on the fringes of the Empire. (map)|Settlement
Raven Rock|A small Imperial mining colony. (map)|Settlement
Skaal Village|A Nordic settlement of devout nature-worshippers. (map)|Settlement
Thirsk|A Nordic mead hall famed for hospitality. (map)|Settlement
Geilir the Mumbling's Dwelling|A home located south of Thormoor's Watch. (map)|Settlement
Graring's House|The home of Graring, located in the northern tip of the Isinfier Plains, where the Harstrad and Isild rivers meet. (map)|Settlement
Kjolver's Dwelling|A small dwelling located between Brodir Grove and the Cave of Hidden Music. (map)|Settlement
Kolfinna's Dwelling|A small cave dwelling along the western bank of the Iggnir River, northeast of Fort Frostmoth. (map)|Settlement
Ulfgar the Unending's Dwelling|A home located in Brodir Grove. (map)|Settlement
Uncle Sweetshare's Workshop|A home located south of Lake Fjalding and east of the Iggnir River, in the Isinfier Plains. (map)|Settlement
Brodir Grove|A landmark in Solstheim located on the border of the Isinfier Plains and the Hirstaang Forest. (map)|Landmark
Castle Karstaag|A fortress in the northwestern region of the island, in the Moesring Mountains region. (map)|Landmark
Hrothmund's Bane|A large Nordic memorial presumably built by the inhabitants of Thirsk after the death of their first chieftain, Hrothmund the Red. (map)|Landmark
Hvitkald Peak|A large, steep mountain northeast of Thormoor's Watch. (map)|Landmark
Mortrag Glacier|A completely frozen mass of ice, totally free of vegetation and beasts, located on the northwest side of Solstheim. (map)|Landmark
Thormoor's Watch|A vantage point located on the northwest area of Solstheim, in the Isinfier Plains. (map)|Landmark
Altar of Thrond|Located in the middle of the island of Solstheim, in the Isinfier Plains. (map)|Landmark
Patchwork Airship|A vessel crashed on the Isinfier Plains, northwest of the Altar of Thrond. (map)|Landmark
Beast Stone|Located near the east side of Solstheim, south of the Skaal Village, in the Felsaad Coast region. (map)|Sacred Stone
Earth Stone|Located northwest from Raven Rock as shown on the paper map. (map)|Sacred Stone
Sun Stone|Located in the southeastern portion of Solstheim. (map)|Sacred Stone
Tree Stone|Located in a valley in the Isinfier Plains, northeast of Brodir Grove just past the border of the Hirstaang Forest, and southeast from the spring of the Harstrad River. (map)|Sacred Stone
Water Stone|A large, dark gray pillar on the side of a mountain in the Moesring Mountains area. (map)|Sacred Stone
Wind Stone|Located on the western shore of Harstrad River. (map)|Sacred Stone
Harstrad River|A stream that forms the eastern boundary of the Moesring Mountains. (map)|Body of Water
Iggnir River|A river in southern Solstheim in the Hirstaang Forest region. (map)|Body of Water
Isild River|A river in northern Solstheim on the Felsaad Coast. (map)|Body of Water
Lake Fjalding|A frozen lake in the Felsaad Coast region of Solstheim. (map)|Body of Water
Bloodskal Barrow|A burial ground on the northern border of the Hirstaang Forest, north-northwest of Raven Rock. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Connorflenge Barrow|A small burial ground east of Uncle Sweetshare's Workshop, along the coast. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Eddard Barrow|A small burial ground located halfway up the continent from Fort Frostmoth, northeast of Raven Rock. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Frosselmane Barrow|A small burial ground located east of Fort Frostmoth, between the mouth of the Iggnir River and the inlet to its west. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Glenschul's Tomb|A small tomb just southeast of Lake Fjalding. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Gyldenhul Barrow|A small burial ground located on an island off the Felsaad Coast. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Himmelhost Barrow|A small burial ground just east of the Iggnir River, about halfway between the mouth and the east shore. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Hrothmund's Barrow|A burial ground located southwest of Castle Karstaag. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Jolgeirr Barrow|A fairly small burial ground southwest of the Altar of Thrond, roughly in the center of the island. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Kelsedolk Barrow|The tomb of a deceased Nord located on the western coast, a short distance south from Raven Rock. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Kolbjorn Barrow|A burial ground south of Raven Rock and west of Fort Frostmoth. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Lukesturm Barrow|A small barrow located directly south of Thirsk and northeast of Brodir Grove. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Skogsdrake Barrow|A medium-sized burial ground just north of the Sun Stone. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Stormpfund Barrow|A medium-sized burial ground just west and a bit north of Fort Frostmoth. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Tombs of Skaalara|An important cavern for the main quest which is located on the eastern coast of the island, southeast from Skaal Village. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Valbrandr Barrow|A burial ground located northeast of the Sun Stone and Skogsdrake Barrow. (map)|Barrow/Tomb
Benkongerike|A large system of ice caves, located northeast of Castle Karstaag, along the white northern shores of the Moesring Mountains region. (map)|Cave
Bjorn|A system of ice caves northeast of the Altar of Thrond and almost directly east of Hvitkald Peak. (map)|Cave
Caves of Fjalding|An ice cave system located on the Felsaad Coast underneath Lake Fjalding. (map)|Cave
Cave of Hidden Music|A cave system located on the Isinfier Plains, northeast of the Earth Stone and northwest of Brodir Grove. (map)|Cave
Domme|A Fryse Hag lair south of the Mortrag Glacier. (map)|Cave
Fjell|A small treasure cave located on the Isinfier Plains to the east of Brodir Grove. (map)|Cave
Frossel|A system of ice caves located southeast of Skaal Village, on the northeastern corner of the Felsaad Coast. (map)|Cave
Frykte|A small ice cave located east of Castle Karstaag. (map)|Cave
Gandrung Caverns|A smugglers hideout northeast of Fort Frostmoth. (map)|Cave
Gloomy Cave|Located just southwest of Lake Fjalding, north of Brodir Grove. (map)|Cave
Gronn|A system of ice caves located southwest of Lake Fjalding on the Isinfier Plains. (map)|Cave
Halls of Penumbra|A medium-sized cave near the Sun Stone in southeastern Solstheim. (map)|Cave
Lair of the Udyrfrykte|A small ice cave on the eastern shore of Lake Fjalding in the Felsaad Coast region. (map)|Cave
Legge|A small ice cave north of Graring's House. (map)|Cave
Rimhull|A small ice cave located west of Skaal Village. (map)|Cave
Sjobal|A small ice cave located northeast of Thirsk. (map)|Cave
Skygge|A small ice cave located west of Skaal Village and north of the bridge across the Isild River. (map)|Cave
Solvjord|A cave due south of the Tree Stone and north of Fort Frostmoth. (map)|Cave
Stahlman's Gorge|A small cave located far west of Mortrag Glacier. (map)|Cave
Varstaad Caves|A cave on the coast in the Moesring Mountains area, north of the Water Stone. (map)|Cave
Supply Ship|A vessel that ran aground about halfway up on the island's west coast, in the Isinfier Plains region. (map)|Ship
